# 统一行尾：避免在 Windows 上出现"改一行、整个文件都被标记为改动"的假 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确声明二进制文件，防止 Git 做行尾转换破坏文件
*.pdf      binary
*.png      binary
*.jpg      binary
*.jpeg     binary
*.gif      binary
*.ico      binary
*.svg      text
*.sqlite3  binary
*.bin      binary
*.woff     binary
*.woff2    binary

# 语言标注（让 GitHub 的语法高亮与语言统计更准确）
*.py       text
*.vue      text
*.js       text
*.json     text
*.yml      text
*.yaml     text
*.md       text
*.sql      text
*.txt      text
